<xml xmlns="https://developers.google.com/blockly/xml"><variables><variable id="v_joy_x">joy_x</variable><variable id="v_player_speed">player_speed</variable><variable id="v_player_x">player_x</variable><variable id="v_bullet_y">bullet_y</variable><variable id="v_fire">fire_pressed</variable><variable id="v_bullet_active">bullet_active</variable><variable id="v_bullet_x">bullet_x</variable><variable id="v_fleet_counter">fleet_counter</variable><variable id="v_enemy_shot_counter">enemy_shot_counter</variable><variable id="v_enemy_bullet_x">enemy_bullet_x</variable><variable id="v_fleet_x">fleet_x</variable><variable id="v_enemy_bullet_y">enemy_bullet_y</variable><variable id="v_enemy_bullet_active">enemy_bullet_active</variable><variable id="v_fleet_dx">fleet_dx</variable><variable id="v_fleet_y">fleet_y</variable><variable id="v_row">row</variable><variable id="v_col">col</variable><variable id="v_lives">lives</variable><variable id="v_idx">idx</variable><variable id="v_invaders">invaders</variable><variable id="v_invader_x">invader_x</variable><variable id="v_alive_count">alive_count</variable><variable id="v_invader_y">invader_y</variable><variable id="v_score">score</variable></variables><block type="program_start" id="space_invaders_start" x="40" y="40"><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">PROGRAM START se provede jednou po spuštění. Připraví displej, joystick a všechny proměnné potřebné pro Space Invaders.</comment><next><block type="oled_init" id="inv_oled_init"><mutation xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" display_type="AUTO"></mutation><field name="DISPLAY_TYPE">AUTO</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Inicializace OLED 128×64. Všechny objekty hry se nejprve kreslí do framebufferu a až na konci snímku se celý obraz odešle na displej.</comment><value name="SDA_PIN"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0001"><field name="NUM">21</field></shadow></value><value name="SCL_PIN"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0002"><field name="NUM">22</field></shadow></value><next><block type="joystick_init" id="inv_joystick_init"><field name="joy_name">1</field><field name="rot">270</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Inicializace joysticku č. 1. Osa X řídí loď relativně a stisk páčky slouží jako FIRE. Piny lze změnit podle použité desky.</comment><value name="vrx"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0003"><field name="NUM">13</field></shadow></value><value name="vry"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0004"><field name="NUM">14</field></shadow></value><value name="sw"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0005"><field name="NUM">15</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0007"><field name="VAR" id="v_joy_x">joy_x</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Aktuální výchylka joysticku v ose X. Přibližný rozsah je -100…+100.</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0006"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0009"><field name="VAR" id="v_player_x">player_x</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Levý horní X bod hráčovy lodi. Sprite je široký 11 px, takže výchozí X=58 umístí loď přibližně doprostřed displeje.</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0008"><field name="NUM">58</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0011"><field name="VAR" id="v_player_speed">player_speed</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Rychlost lodi v pixelech za jeden průchod hlavní smyčky.</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0010"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0013"><field name="VAR" id="v_fire">fire_pressed</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Stav tlačítka joysticku. Nula znamená, že FIRE není stisknutý.</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0012"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0015"><field name="VAR" id="v_bullet_x">bullet_x</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">X souřadnice hráčovy střely.</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0014"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0017"><field name="VAR" id="v_bullet_y">bullet_y</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Y souřadnice hráčovy střely.</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0016"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0019"><field name="VAR" id="v_bullet_active">bullet_active</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Příznak hráčovy střely. V jednu chvíli existuje nejvýše jedna střela, což výrazně zjednodušuje první výukovou verzi.</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0018"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0021"><field name="VAR" id="v_enemy_bullet_x">enemy_bullet_x</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">X souřadnice nepřátelské střely.</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0020"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0023"><field name="VAR" id="v_enemy_bullet_y">enemy_bullet_y</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Y souřadnice nepřátelské střely.</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0022"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0025"><field name="VAR" id="v_enemy_bullet_active">enemy_bullet_active</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Příznak nepřátelské střely. I vetřelci používají maximálně jednu současnou střelu.</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0024"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0027"><field name="VAR" id="v_enemy_shot_counter">enemy_shot_counter</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Jednoduchý čítač určující, kdy vetřelci vystřelí. Učí oddělit rychlost hry od časování konkrétní události.</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0026"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0029"><field name="VAR" id="v_fleet_x">fleet_x</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Společný horizontální posun celé formace vetřelců. Místo změny 18 souřadnic měníme jedinou proměnnou.</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0028"><field name="NUM">12</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0031"><field name="VAR" id="v_fleet_y">fleet_y</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Společný vertikální posun formace vetřelců.</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0030"><field name="NUM">6</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0033"><field name="VAR" id="v_fleet_dx">fleet_dx</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Směr horizontálního pohybu formace. +1 znamená doprava a -1 doleva.</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0032"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0035"><field name="VAR" id="v_fleet_counter">fleet_counter</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Čítač zpomalující formaci. Vetřelci se neposouvají při každém průchodu hlavní smyčky.</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0034"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0039"><field name="VAR" id="v_invaders">invaders</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Pole invaders obsahuje stav všech vetřelců. Díky poli nemusíme vytvářet 18 samostatných proměnných.</comment><value name="VALUE"><block type="lists_repeat" id="b0038"><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Vytvoří pole 18 jedniček: 3 řádky × 6 sloupců. Hodnota 1 = živý vetřelec, 0 = zničený.</comment><value name="ITEM"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0036"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value><value name="NUM"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0037"><field name="NUM">18</field></shadow></value></block></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0041"><field name="VAR" id="v_alive_count">alive_count</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Počet dosud živých vetřelců. Po každém zásahu se sníží o 1.</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0040"><field name="NUM">18</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0043"><field name="VAR" id="v_score">score</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Skóre hráče. Za každého zničeného vetřelce získá jeden bod.</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0042"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0045"><field name="VAR" id="v_lives">lives</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Hráč začíná se třemi životy. Zásah nepřátelskou střelou odebere jeden život.</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0044"><field name="NUM">3</field></shadow></value></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block><block type="program_loop" id="space_invaders_loop" x="720" y="40"><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">PROGRAM LOOP je hlavní herní smyčka: vstup → aktualizace objektů → kolize → herní pravidla → vykreslení. Toto pořadí je základní architektura většiny real-time her.</comment><statement name="DO"><block type="variables_set" id="b0046"><field name="VAR" id="v_joy_x">joy_x</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Na začátku snímku uložíme výchylku joysticku do proměnné joy_x.</comment><value name="VALUE"><block type="get_joy_axis_ble" id="inv_get_joy_x"><field name="joy_name">1</field><field name="axis">X</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Přečte osu X joysticku. Hodnota neurčuje přímo pozici lodi, ale její rychlost a směr.</comment></block></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0060"><field name="VAR" id="v_player_speed">player_speed</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Mimo mrtvou zónu se rychlost vypočítá z velikosti výchylky joysticku.</comment><value name="VALUE"><block type="math_round" id="b0059"><field name="OP">ROUND</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Zaokrouhlení převádí rychlost na celé pixely.</comment><value name="NUM"><block type="math_arithmetic" id="b0058"><field name="OP">DIVIDE</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Výchylku dělíme 25. Rozsah -100…+100 se převede přibližně na rychlost -4…+4 px za snímek.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0056"><field name="VAR" id="v_joy_x">joy_x</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0057"><field name="NUM">25</field></shadow></value></block></value></block></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0068"><field name="VAR" id="v_player_x">player_x</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Aktualizace horizontální polohy hráčovy lodi.</comment><value name="VALUE"><block type="math_constrain" id="b0067"><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Omezení 0…117 brání 11px široké lodi opustit 128px displej.</comment><value name="VALUE"><block type="math_arithmetic" id="b0064"><field name="OP">ADD</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Nová poloha = stará poloha + rychlost.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0062"><field name="VAR" id="v_player_x">player_x</field></block></value><value name="B"><block type="variables_get" id="b0063"><field name="VAR" id="v_player_speed">player_speed</field></block></value></block></value><value name="LOW"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0065"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value><value name="HIGH"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0066"><field name="NUM">117</field></shadow></value></block></value><next><block type="controls_if" id="b0082"><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Aktualizace hráčovy střely.</comment><value name="IF0"><block type="logic_compare" id="b0081"><field name="OP">EQ</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Pohyb provádíme pouze tehdy, když střela skutečně existuje.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0079"><field name="VAR" id="v_bullet_active">bullet_active</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0080"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value></block></value><statement name="DO0"><block type="variables_set" id="b0072"><field name="VAR" id="v_bullet_y">bullet_y</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Posun aktivní hráčovy střely o 3 pixely nahoru.</comment><value name="VALUE"><block type="math_arithmetic" id="b0071"><field name="OP">MINUS</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Střela hráče letí vzhůru: její Y se každý snímek zmenší o 3 px.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0069"><field name="VAR" id="v_bullet_y">bullet_y</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0070"><field name="NUM">3</field></shadow></value></block></value><next><block type="controls_if" id="b0078"><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Odstranění střely mimo obrazovku.</comment><value name="IF0"><block type="logic_compare" id="b0075"><field name="OP">LT</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Jakmile střela opustí horní okraj, už ji nepotřebujeme.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0073"><field name="VAR" id="v_bullet_y">bullet_y</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0074"><field name="NUM">-2</field></shadow></value></block></value><statement name="DO0"><block type="variables_set" id="b0077"><field name="VAR" id="v_bullet_active">bullet_active</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Střela se deaktivuje a hráč může vystřelit další.</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0076"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value></block></statement></block></next></block></statement><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0083"><field name="VAR" id="v_fire">fire_pressed</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Přečtení tlačítka joysticku.</comment><value name="VALUE"><block type="get_joy_state_ble" id="inv_fire_button"><field name="joy_name">1</field><field name="axis">5</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Vrátí stav tlačítka joysticku. Stisk slouží jako FIRE.</comment></block></value><next><block type="controls_if" id="b0099"><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Vytvoření nové střely po stisku tlačítka. Jedna současná střela je výukově jednoduchá a připomíná původní Space Invaders.</comment><value name="IF0"><block type="logic_operation" id="b0090"><field name="OP">AND</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Obě podmínky musí být splněné současně: žádná střela + stisk FIRE.</comment><value name="A"><block type="logic_compare" id="b0086"><field name="OP">EQ</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Novou střelu vytvoříme jen tehdy, pokud žádná předchozí není aktivní.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0084"><field name="VAR" id="v_bullet_active">bullet_active</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0085"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value></block></value><value name="B"><block type="logic_compare" id="b0089"><field name="OP">EQ</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Druhá podmínka vyžaduje stisk tlačítka.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0087"><field name="VAR" id="v_fire">fire_pressed</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0088"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value></block></value></block></value><statement name="DO0"><block type="variables_set" id="b0092"><field name="VAR" id="v_bullet_active">bullet_active</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Aktivace nové hráčovy střely.</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0091"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0096"><field name="VAR" id="v_bullet_x">bullet_x</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">X střely se nastaví na střed hráčovy lodi.</comment><value name="VALUE"><block type="math_arithmetic" id="b0095"><field name="OP">ADD</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Loď je široká 11 px; +5 umístí střelu přibližně do jejího středu.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0093"><field name="VAR" id="v_player_x">player_x</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0094"><field name="NUM">5</field></shadow></value></block></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0098"><field name="VAR" id="v_bullet_y">bullet_y</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Střela začíná těsně nad lodí, která je vykreslena od Y=57.</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0097"><field name="NUM">54</field></shadow></value></block></next></block></next></block></statement><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0103"><field name="VAR" id="v_fleet_counter">fleet_counter</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Zpomalení vetřelců nezávisle na rychlosti překreslování.</comment><value name="VALUE"><block type="math_arithmetic" id="b0102"><field name="OP">ADD</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Čítač se při každém snímku zvýší o 1.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0100"><field name="VAR" id="v_fleet_counter">fleet_counter</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0101"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value></block></value><next><block type="controls_if" id="b0129"><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Vetřelci jsou záměrně pomalejší než hráčova loď a střely.</comment><value name="IF0"><block type="logic_compare" id="b0128"><field name="OP">GT</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Pohyb nastane každý druhý průchod smyčkou.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0126"><field name="VAR" id="v_fleet_counter">fleet_counter</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0127"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value></block></value><statement name="DO0"><block type="variables_set" id="b0105"><field name="VAR" id="v_fleet_counter">fleet_counter</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Po provedení pohybu čítač začíná znovu od nuly.</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0104"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0109"><field name="VAR" id="v_fleet_x">fleet_x</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Posun celé formace jedinou změnou fleet_x.</comment><value name="VALUE"><block type="math_arithmetic" id="b0108"><field name="OP">ADD</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Celá formace se posune o +1 nebo -1 pixel podle fleet_dx.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0106"><field name="VAR" id="v_fleet_x">fleet_x</field></block></value><value name="B"><block type="variables_get" id="b0107"><field name="VAR" id="v_fleet_dx">fleet_dx</field></block></value></block></value><next><block type="controls_if" id="b0125"><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Kontrola okraje se provádí po horizontálním posunu.</comment><value name="IF0"><block type="logic_operation" id="b0116"><field name="OP">OR</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Formace se na kraji musí otočit.</comment><value name="A"><block type="logic_compare" id="b0112"><field name="OP">LT</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Levá bezpečná hranice formace.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0110"><field name="VAR" id="v_fleet_x">fleet_x</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0111"><field name="NUM">2</field></shadow></value></block></value><value name="B"><block type="logic_compare" id="b0115"><field name="OP">GT</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Pravá bezpečná hranice. Pravý vetřelec je ještě o 55+8 px dále.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0113"><field name="VAR" id="v_fleet_x">fleet_x</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0114"><field name="NUM">60</field></shadow></value></block></value></block></value><statement name="DO0"><block type="variables_set" id="b0120"><field name="VAR" id="v_fleet_dx">fleet_dx</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Obrácení směru pohybu vetřelců.</comment><value name="VALUE"><block type="math_arithmetic" id="b0119"><field name="OP">MINUS</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">0 - fleet_dx změní +1 na -1 a opačně.</comment><value name="A"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0117"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value><value name="B"><block type="variables_get" id="b0118"><field name="VAR" id="v_fleet_dx">fleet_dx</field></block></value></block></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0124"><field name="VAR" id="v_fleet_y">fleet_y</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Klasické chování Space Invaders: na kraji se vetřelci posunou o řádek níže.</comment><value name="VALUE"><block type="math_arithmetic" id="b0123"><field name="OP">ADD</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Při každém odrazu od okraje formace sestoupí o 2 pixely.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0121"><field name="VAR" id="v_fleet_y">fleet_y</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0122"><field name="NUM">2</field></shadow></value></block></value></block></next></block></statement></block></next></block></next></block></statement><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0133"><field name="VAR" id="v_enemy_shot_counter">enemy_shot_counter</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Časování nepřátelské střelby bez čekacího bloku.</comment><value name="VALUE"><block type="math_arithmetic" id="b0132"><field name="OP">ADD</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Počítáme průchody hlavní smyčkou mezi nepřátelskými výstřely.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0130"><field name="VAR" id="v_enemy_shot_counter">enemy_shot_counter</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0131"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value></block></value><next><block type="controls_if" id="b0153"><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Vetřelci periodicky střílejí směrem k hráči.</comment><value name="IF0"><block type="logic_operation" id="b0140"><field name="OP">AND</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Jednoduchý generátor nepřátelské střelby.</comment><value name="A"><block type="logic_compare" id="b0136"><field name="OP">EQ</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Vetřelci vytvoří novou střelu jen pokud předchozí už neexistuje.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0134"><field name="VAR" id="v_enemy_bullet_active">enemy_bullet_active</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0135"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value></block></value><value name="B"><block type="logic_compare" id="b0139"><field name="OP">GT</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Po přibližně 35 snímcích se pokusí vystřelit.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0137"><field name="VAR" id="v_enemy_shot_counter">enemy_shot_counter</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0138"><field name="NUM">35</field></shadow></value></block></value></block></value><statement name="DO0"><block type="variables_set" id="b0142"><field name="VAR" id="v_enemy_bullet_active">enemy_bullet_active</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Aktivace nepřátelské střely.</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0141"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0146"><field name="VAR" id="v_enemy_bullet_x">enemy_bullet_x</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Výpočet X nepřátelské střely.</comment><value name="VALUE"><block type="math_arithmetic" id="b0145"><field name="OP">ADD</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Střela vychází přibližně ze středu formace. Je to záměrně zjednodušená AI pro výukový projekt.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0143"><field name="VAR" id="v_fleet_x">fleet_x</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0144"><field name="NUM">30</field></shadow></value></block></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0150"><field name="VAR" id="v_enemy_bullet_y">enemy_bullet_y</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Střela vznikne pod formací vetřelců.</comment><value name="VALUE"><block type="math_arithmetic" id="b0149"><field name="OP">ADD</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Tři řádky vetřelců zabírají přibližně 24 px výšky.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0147"><field name="VAR" id="v_fleet_y">fleet_y</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0148"><field name="NUM">24</field></shadow></value></block></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0152"><field name="VAR" id="v_enemy_shot_counter">enemy_shot_counter</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Po výstřelu se interval začne počítat znovu.</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0151"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></statement><next><block type="controls_if" id="b0197"><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Aktualizace nepřátelské střely.</comment><value name="IF0"><block type="logic_compare" id="b0196"><field name="OP">EQ</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Pohyb a kolizi řešíme pouze pro aktivní střelu.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0194"><field name="VAR" id="v_enemy_bullet_active">enemy_bullet_active</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0195"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value></block></value><statement name="DO0"><block type="variables_set" id="b0157"><field name="VAR" id="v_enemy_bullet_y">enemy_bullet_y</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Posun nepřátelské střely o 2 px dolů.</comment><value name="VALUE"><block type="math_arithmetic" id="b0156"><field name="OP">ADD</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Nepřátelská střela letí dolů, proto se její Y zvětšuje.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0154"><field name="VAR" id="v_enemy_bullet_y">enemy_bullet_y</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0155"><field name="NUM">2</field></shadow></value></block></value><next><block type="controls_if" id="b0163"><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Odstranění nepřátelské střely mimo obrazovku.</comment><value name="IF0"><block type="logic_compare" id="b0160"><field name="OP">GT</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Střela překročila spodní okraj displeje.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0158"><field name="VAR" id="v_enemy_bullet_y">enemy_bullet_y</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0159"><field name="NUM">63</field></shadow></value></block></value><statement name="DO0"><block type="variables_set" id="b0162"><field name="VAR" id="v_enemy_bullet_active">enemy_bullet_active</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Deaktivace střely mimo displej.</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0161"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value></block></statement><next><block type="controls_if" id="b0193"><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Jednoduchá obdélníková kolize nepřátelské střely s lodí.</comment><value name="IF0"><block type="logic_operation" id="b0186"><field name="OP">AND</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Kolize nastane pouze při překrytí v ose X i Y.</comment><value name="A"><block type="logic_operation" id="b0176"><field name="OP">AND</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Horizontální překrytí střely a 11px široké lodi.</comment><value name="A"><block type="logic_compare" id="b0170"><field name="OP">GT</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Střela je napravo od levého okraje lodi.</comment><value name="A"><block type="math_arithmetic" id="b0166"><field name="OP">ADD</field><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0164"><field name="VAR" id="v_enemy_bullet_x">enemy_bullet_x</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0165"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value></block></value><value name="B"><block type="math_arithmetic" id="b0169"><field name="OP">MINUS</field><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0167"><field name="VAR" id="v_player_x">player_x</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0168"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value></block></value></block></value><value name="B"><block type="logic_compare" id="b0175"><field name="OP">LT</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Střela je nalevo od pravého okraje lodi.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0171"><field name="VAR" id="v_enemy_bullet_x">enemy_bullet_x</field></block></value><value name="B"><block type="math_arithmetic" id="b0174"><field name="OP">ADD</field><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0172"><field name="VAR" id="v_player_x">player_x</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0173"><field name="NUM">11</field></shadow></value></block></value></block></value></block></value><value name="B"><block type="logic_operation" id="b0185"><field name="OP">AND</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Vertikální překrytí střely a lodi.</comment><value name="A"><block type="logic_compare" id="b0181"><field name="OP">GT</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Spodní část 3px střely dosáhla oblasti lodi.</comment><value name="A"><block type="math_arithmetic" id="b0179"><field name="OP">ADD</field><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0177"><field name="VAR" id="v_enemy_bullet_y">enemy_bullet_y</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0178"><field name="NUM">2</field></shadow></value></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0180"><field name="NUM">56</field></shadow></value></block></value><value name="B"><block type="logic_compare" id="b0184"><field name="OP">LT</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Horní část střely je ještě nad spodním okrajem lodi.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0182"><field name="VAR" id="v_enemy_bullet_y">enemy_bullet_y</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0183"><field name="NUM">63</field></shadow></value></block></value></block></value></block></value><statement name="DO0"><block type="variables_set" id="b0188"><field name="VAR" id="v_enemy_bullet_active">enemy_bullet_active</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Po zásahu nepřátelská střela zmizí.</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0187"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0192"><field name="VAR" id="v_lives">lives</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Zásah nepřátelskou střelou odebere život.</comment><value name="VALUE"><block type="math_arithmetic" id="b0191"><field name="OP">MINUS</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Ztráta jednoho života: lives - 1.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0189"><field name="VAR" id="v_lives">lives</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0190"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value></block></value></block></next></block></statement></block></next></block></next></block></statement><next><block type="controls_if" id="b0281"><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Kontrola zásahu hráčovy střely do formace vetřelců.</comment><value name="IF0"><block type="logic_compare" id="b0280"><field name="OP">EQ</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Pokud hráčova střela není aktivní, celou náročnější kontrolu 18 vetřelců přeskočíme.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0278"><field name="VAR" id="v_bullet_active">bullet_active</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0279"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value></block></value><statement name="DO0"><block type="controls_for" id="b0277"><field name="VAR" id="v_row">row</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Vnější smyčka projde tři řádky formace. Dohromady tak zkontrolujeme 18 vetřelců.</comment><value name="FROM"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0274"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value><value name="TO"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0275"><field name="NUM">2</field></shadow></value><value name="BY"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0276"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value><statement name="DO"><block type="controls_for" id="b0273"><field name="VAR" id="v_col">col</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Vnitřní smyčka projde šest sloupců aktuálního řádku.</comment><value name="FROM"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0270"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value><value name="TO"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0271"><field name="NUM">5</field></shadow></value><value name="BY"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0272"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value><statement name="DO"><block type="variables_set" id="b0203"><field name="VAR" id="v_idx">idx</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Převod dvojice řádek/sloupec na index 0…17.</comment><value name="VALUE"><block type="math_arithmetic" id="b0202"><field name="OP">ADD</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Lineární index = row × 6 + col.</comment><value name="A"><block type="math_arithmetic" id="b0200"><field name="OP">MULTIPLY</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Každý řádek má 6 vetřelců, proto začíná na row × 6.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0198"><field name="VAR" id="v_row">row</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0199"><field name="NUM">6</field></shadow></value></block></value><value name="B"><block type="variables_get" id="b0201"><field name="VAR" id="v_col">col</field></block></value></block></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0209"><field name="VAR" id="v_invader_x">invader_x</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Výpočet skutečné X souřadnice aktuálního vetřelce.</comment><value name="VALUE"><block type="math_arithmetic" id="b0208"><field name="OP">ADD</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">X vetřelce = společný posun formace + sloupec × 11.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0204"><field name="VAR" id="v_fleet_x">fleet_x</field></block></value><value name="B"><block type="math_arithmetic" id="b0207"><field name="OP">MULTIPLY</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Jedna buňka formace má krok 11 px: 8px sprite + 3px mezera.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0205"><field name="VAR" id="v_col">col</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0206"><field name="NUM">11</field></shadow></value></block></value></block></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0215"><field name="VAR" id="v_invader_y">invader_y</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Výpočet skutečné Y souřadnice aktuálního vetřelce.</comment><value name="VALUE"><block type="math_arithmetic" id="b0214"><field name="OP">ADD</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Y vetřelce = společný posun formace + řádek × 9.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0210"><field name="VAR" id="v_fleet_y">fleet_y</field></block></value><value name="B"><block type="math_arithmetic" id="b0213"><field name="OP">MULTIPLY</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Řádky jsou od sebe vzdálené 9 px: 6px sprite + 3px mezera.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0211"><field name="VAR" id="v_row">row</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0212"><field name="NUM">9</field></shadow></value></block></value></block></value><next><block type="controls_if" id="b0269"><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Mrtvý vetřelec se při kolizích přeskočí.</comment><value name="IF0"><block type="logic_compare" id="b0222"><field name="OP">EQ</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Kolizi kontrolujeme pouze se živým vetřelcem.</comment><value name="A"><block type="lists_getIndex" id="b0220"><mutation statement="false" at="true"></mutation><field name="MODE">GET</field><field name="WHERE">FROM_START</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Přečte stav aktuálního vetřelce z pole invaders.</comment><value name="VALUE"><block type="variables_get" id="b0219"><field name="VAR" id="v_invaders">invaders</field></block></value><value name="AT"><block type="math_arithmetic" id="b0218"><field name="OP">ADD</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Přičtení 1 převádí interní index 0…17 na pozici 1…18 používanou blokem seznamu.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0216"><field name="VAR" id="v_idx">idx</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0217"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value></block></value></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0221"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value></block></value><statement name="DO0"><block type="controls_if" id="b0268"><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Kolize střely s konkrétním živým vetřelcem.</comment><value name="IF0"><block type="logic_operation" id="b0251"><field name="OP">AND</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Zásah vyžaduje aktivní střelu a geometrickou kolizi.</comment><value name="A"><block type="logic_compare" id="b0249"><field name="OP">EQ</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Tato podmínka zabraňuje jedné střele zničit více vetřelců ve stejném průchodu smyčky.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0247"><field name="VAR" id="v_bullet_active">bullet_active</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0248"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value></block></value><value name="B"><block type="logic_operation" id="b0250"><field name="OP">AND</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Souřadnice se musí překrývat v obou osách.</comment><value name="A"><block type="logic_operation" id="b0233"><field name="OP">AND</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Horizontální překrytí střely a vetřelce.</comment><value name="A"><block type="logic_compare" id="b0227"><field name="OP">GT</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Střela je vpravo od levého okraje vetřelce.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0223"><field name="VAR" id="v_bullet_x">bullet_x</field></block></value><value name="B"><block type="math_arithmetic" id="b0226"><field name="OP">MINUS</field><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0224"><field name="VAR" id="v_invader_x">invader_x</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0225"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value></block></value></block></value><value name="B"><block type="logic_compare" id="b0232"><field name="OP">LT</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Střela je vlevo od pravého okraje 8px sprite.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0228"><field name="VAR" id="v_bullet_x">bullet_x</field></block></value><value name="B"><block type="math_arithmetic" id="b0231"><field name="OP">ADD</field><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0229"><field name="VAR" id="v_invader_x">invader_x</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0230"><field name="NUM">8</field></shadow></value></block></value></block></value></block></value><value name="B"><block type="logic_operation" id="b0246"><field name="OP">AND</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Vertikální překrytí střely a vetřelce.</comment><value name="A"><block type="logic_compare" id="b0240"><field name="OP">GT</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Spodní část střely dosáhla horního okraje vetřelce.</comment><value name="A"><block type="math_arithmetic" id="b0236"><field name="OP">ADD</field><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0234"><field name="VAR" id="v_bullet_y">bullet_y</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0235"><field name="NUM">2</field></shadow></value></block></value><value name="B"><block type="math_arithmetic" id="b0239"><field name="OP">MINUS</field><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0237"><field name="VAR" id="v_invader_y">invader_y</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0238"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value></block></value></block></value><value name="B"><block type="logic_compare" id="b0245"><field name="OP">LT</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Horní část střely ještě není pod 6px vysokým vetřelcem.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0241"><field name="VAR" id="v_bullet_y">bullet_y</field></block></value><value name="B"><block type="math_arithmetic" id="b0244"><field name="OP">ADD</field><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0242"><field name="VAR" id="v_invader_y">invader_y</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0243"><field name="NUM">6</field></shadow></value></block></value></block></value></block></value></block></value></block></value><statement name="DO0"><block type="lists_setIndex" id="b0257"><mutation at="true"></mutation><field name="MODE">SET</field><field name="WHERE">FROM_START</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Zasaženého vetřelce přepneme v poli z 1 na 0. Tím zmizí z vykreslování i dalších kolizí.</comment><value name="LIST"><block type="variables_get" id="b0256"><field name="VAR" id="v_invaders">invaders</field></block></value><value name="AT"><block type="math_arithmetic" id="b0255"><field name="OP">ADD</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Převod interního indexu 0…17 na jedničkovou pozici v seznamu.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0252"><field name="VAR" id="v_idx">idx</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0254"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value></block></value><value name="TO"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0253"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0259"><field name="VAR" id="v_bullet_active">bullet_active</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Hráčova střela po zásahu zanikne.</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0258"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0263"><field name="VAR" id="v_score">score</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Aktualizace skóre.</comment><value name="VALUE"><block type="math_arithmetic" id="b0262"><field name="OP">ADD</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Za zničeného vetřelce přičteme jeden bod.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0260"><field name="VAR" id="v_score">score</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0261"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value></block></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0267"><field name="VAR" id="v_alive_count">alive_count</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Alive_count umožní snadno poznat konec celé vlny.</comment><value name="VALUE"><block type="math_arithmetic" id="b0266"><field name="OP">MINUS</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Počet živých vetřelců snížíme o 1.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0264"><field name="VAR" id="v_alive_count">alive_count</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0265"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value></block></value></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></statement></block></statement></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></statement></block></statement></block></statement><next><block type="controls_if" id="b0287"><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Vetřelci nesmějí sestoupit až k hráči.</comment><value name="IF0"><block type="logic_compare" id="b0284"><field name="OP">GT</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Pokud společný Y posun překročí 30, spodní řada vetřelců je nebezpečně blízko lodi.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0282"><field name="VAR" id="v_fleet_y">fleet_y</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0283"><field name="NUM">30</field></shadow></value></block></value><statement name="DO0"><block type="variables_set" id="b0286"><field name="VAR" id="v_lives">lives</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Dosažení spodní části obrazovky znamená GAME OVER.</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0285"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value></block></statement><next><block type="controls_if" id="b0311"><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Vítězství nad celou vlnou automaticky vytvoří novou formaci.</comment><value name="IF0"><block type="logic_compare" id="b0310"><field name="OP">EQ</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Jakmile nezbývá žádný živý vetřelec, hráč vlnu dokončil.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0308"><field name="VAR" id="v_alive_count">alive_count</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0309"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value></block></value><statement name="DO0"><block type="variables_set" id="b0291"><field name="VAR" id="v_invaders">invaders</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Reset pole vetřelců po vítězství.</comment><value name="VALUE"><block type="lists_repeat" id="b0290"><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Nová vlna znovu vytvoří 18 živých vetřelců.</comment><value name="ITEM"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0288"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value><value name="NUM"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0289"><field name="NUM">18</field></shadow></value></block></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0293"><field name="VAR" id="v_alive_count">alive_count</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Nová vlna má opět 18 živých nepřátel.</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0292"><field name="NUM">18</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0295"><field name="VAR" id="v_score">score</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Skóre v této jednoduché verzi zároveň ukazuje postup aktuální vlnou, proto se při nové vlně vynuluje.</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0294"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0297"><field name="VAR" id="v_fleet_x">fleet_x</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Formace se vrátí na výchozí X.</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0296"><field name="NUM">12</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0299"><field name="VAR" id="v_fleet_y">fleet_y</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Formace se vrátí nahoru.</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0298"><field name="NUM">6</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0301"><field name="VAR" id="v_fleet_dx">fleet_dx</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Nová vlna začne pohybem doprava.</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0300"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0303"><field name="VAR" id="v_bullet_active">bullet_active</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Odstranění případné hráčovy střely při přechodu na novou vlnu.</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0302"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0305"><field name="VAR" id="v_enemy_bullet_active">enemy_bullet_active</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Odstranění nepřátelské střely při přechodu na novou vlnu.</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0304"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0307"><field name="VAR" id="v_enemy_shot_counter">enemy_shot_counter</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Časovač střelby začíná znovu.</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0306"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></statement><next><block type="controls_if" id="b0341"><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Jednoduchý automatický restart po ztrátě všech životů.</comment><value name="IF0"><block type="logic_compare" id="b0340"><field name="OP">LT</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Nula životů znamená GAME OVER.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0338"><field name="VAR" id="v_lives">lives</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0339"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value></block></value><statement name="DO0"><block type="variables_set" id="b0313"><field name="VAR" id="v_lives">lives</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Po GAME OVER dostane hráč znovu tři životy.</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0312"><field name="NUM">3</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0315"><field name="VAR" id="v_score">score</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Nová hra začíná od skóre 0.</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0314"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0317"><field name="VAR" id="v_player_x">player_x</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Loď se vrátí doprostřed.</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0316"><field name="NUM">58</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0321"><field name="VAR" id="v_invaders">invaders</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Nová hra vytvoří celou formaci vetřelců.</comment><value name="VALUE"><block type="lists_repeat" id="b0320"><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Všechny pozice nové hry začínají jako živé.</comment><value name="ITEM"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0318"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value><value name="NUM"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0319"><field name="NUM">18</field></shadow></value></block></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0323"><field name="VAR" id="v_alive_count">alive_count</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Obnovení počtu živých vetřelců.</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0322"><field name="NUM">18</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0325"><field name="VAR" id="v_fleet_x">fleet_x</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Reset horizontálního posunu formace.</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0324"><field name="NUM">12</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0327"><field name="VAR" id="v_fleet_y">fleet_y</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Reset vertikálního posunu formace.</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0326"><field name="NUM">6</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0329"><field name="VAR" id="v_fleet_dx">fleet_dx</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Reset směru formace.</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0328"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0331"><field name="VAR" id="v_fleet_counter">fleet_counter</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Reset čítače pohybu formace.</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0330"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0333"><field name="VAR" id="v_bullet_active">bullet_active</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Odstranění hráčovy střely.</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0332"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0335"><field name="VAR" id="v_enemy_bullet_active">enemy_bullet_active</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Odstranění nepřátelské střely.</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0334"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0337"><field name="VAR" id="v_enemy_shot_counter">enemy_shot_counter</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Reset časování nepřátelské střelby.</comment><value name="VALUE"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0336"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></statement><next><block type="fb_fill" id="inv_clear"><field name="barva">0</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Začátek vykreslování snímku. Celý framebuffer vyplníme černou, aby po pohybujících se objektech nezůstávaly stopy.</comment><next><block type="fb_rect_fill" id="b0349"><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Krátký pruh vlevo nahoře zobrazuje počet životů bez potřeby textového fontu.</comment><value name="px"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0345"><field name="NUM">2</field></shadow></value><value name="py"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0346"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value><value name="sirka"><block type="math_arithmetic" id="b0344"><field name="OP">MULTIPLY</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Každý život zabírá v ukazateli 4 pixely.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0342"><field name="VAR" id="v_lives">lives</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0343"><field name="NUM">4</field></shadow></value></block></value><value name="vyska"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0347"><field name="NUM">2</field></shadow></value><value name="col"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0348"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value><next><block type="fb_rect_fill" id="b0357"><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Horní ukazatel skóre/progresu. Při 18 zásazích má šířku 54 px.</comment><value name="px"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0353"><field name="NUM">20</field></shadow></value><value name="py"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0354"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value><value name="sirka"><block type="math_arithmetic" id="b0352"><field name="OP">MULTIPLY</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Každý zásah přidá 3 pixely do ukazatele postupu vlnou.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0350"><field name="VAR" id="v_score">score</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0351"><field name="NUM">3</field></shadow></value></block></value><value name="vyska"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0355"><field name="NUM">2</field></shadow></value><value name="col"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0356"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value><next><block type="controls_for" id="b0415"><field name="VAR" id="v_row">row</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Vykreslovací smyčka přes tři řádky. Jedna dvojice smyček tak nakreslí celou formaci.</comment><value name="FROM"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0412"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value><value name="TO"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0413"><field name="NUM">2</field></shadow></value><value name="BY"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0414"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value><statement name="DO"><block type="controls_for" id="b0411"><field name="VAR" id="v_col">col</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Vykreslovací smyčka přes šest sloupců.</comment><value name="FROM"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0408"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value><value name="TO"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0409"><field name="NUM">5</field></shadow></value><value name="BY"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0410"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value><statement name="DO"><block type="variables_set" id="b0363"><field name="VAR" id="v_idx">idx</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Výpočet indexu vetřelce při kreslení.</comment><value name="VALUE"><block type="math_arithmetic" id="b0362"><field name="OP">ADD</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Index aktuálního vetřelce pro vykreslení.</comment><value name="A"><block type="math_arithmetic" id="b0360"><field name="OP">MULTIPLY</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Stejný převod řádku na začátek šestiprvkové části pole.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0358"><field name="VAR" id="v_row">row</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0359"><field name="NUM">6</field></shadow></value></block></value><value name="B"><block type="variables_get" id="b0361"><field name="VAR" id="v_col">col</field></block></value></block></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0369"><field name="VAR" id="v_invader_x">invader_x</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Skutečná X souřadnice vetřelce.</comment><value name="VALUE"><block type="math_arithmetic" id="b0368"><field name="OP">ADD</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Výpočet X sprite vetřelce.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0364"><field name="VAR" id="v_fleet_x">fleet_x</field></block></value><value name="B"><block type="math_arithmetic" id="b0367"><field name="OP">MULTIPLY</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Sloupce jsou od sebe 11 px.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0365"><field name="VAR" id="v_col">col</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0366"><field name="NUM">11</field></shadow></value></block></value></block></value><next><block type="variables_set" id="b0375"><field name="VAR" id="v_invader_y">invader_y</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Skutečná Y souřadnice vetřelce.</comment><value name="VALUE"><block type="math_arithmetic" id="b0374"><field name="OP">ADD</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Výpočet Y sprite vetřelce.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0370"><field name="VAR" id="v_fleet_y">fleet_y</field></block></value><value name="B"><block type="math_arithmetic" id="b0373"><field name="OP">MULTIPLY</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Řádky jsou od sebe 9 px.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0371"><field name="VAR" id="v_row">row</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0372"><field name="NUM">9</field></shadow></value></block></value></block></value><next><block type="controls_if" id="b0407"><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Živému vetřelci přiřadíme sprite podle čísla jeho řádku.</comment><value name="IF0"><block type="logic_compare" id="b0382"><field name="OP">EQ</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Kreslí se jen vetřelci se stavem 1.</comment><value name="A"><block type="lists_getIndex" id="b0380"><mutation statement="false" at="true"></mutation><field name="MODE">GET</field><field name="WHERE">FROM_START</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Při vykreslování znovu čteme stav vetřelce z pole.</comment><value name="VALUE"><block type="variables_get" id="b0379"><field name="VAR" id="v_invaders">invaders</field></block></value><value name="AT"><block type="math_arithmetic" id="b0378"><field name="OP">ADD</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Přičtení 1 převádí interní index 0…17 na pozici 1…18 používanou blokem seznamu.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0376"><field name="VAR" id="v_idx">idx</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0377"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value></block></value></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0381"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value></block></value><statement name="DO0"><block type="controls_if" id="b0390"><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Výběr grafiky pro horní řádek.</comment><value name="IF0"><block type="logic_compare" id="b0385"><field name="OP">EQ</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">První řádek používá sprite typu A.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0383"><field name="VAR" id="v_row">row</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0384"><field name="NUM">0</field></shadow></value></block></value><statement name="DO0"><block type="fb_draw_pic" id="b0389"><field name="name">Invader_A_8x6</field><field name="alpha">-1</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Sprite A, 8×6 px:
  ####  
########
## ## ##
########
  #  #  
 #    # 
Každý sloupec obrázku je uložen jako jeden bajt framebufferu.</comment><value name="px"><block type="variables_get" id="b0386"><field name="VAR" id="v_invader_x">invader_x</field></block></value><value name="py"><block type="variables_get" id="b0387"><field name="VAR" id="v_invader_y">invader_y</field></block></value><value name="data"><shadow type="text" id="t0388"><field name="TEXT">bytearray(b'\x0e\x2e\x1b\x0f\x0f\x1b\x2e\x0e'), 8, 8</field></shadow></value></block></statement><next><block type="controls_if" id="b0398"><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Výběr grafiky pro prostřední řádek.</comment><value name="IF0"><block type="logic_compare" id="b0393"><field name="OP">EQ</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Prostřední řádek používá sprite typu B.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0391"><field name="VAR" id="v_row">row</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0392"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value></block></value><statement name="DO0"><block type="fb_draw_pic" id="b0397"><field name="name">Invader_B_8x6</field><field name="alpha">-1</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Sprite B, 8×6 px:
  #  #  
   ##   
 ###### 
## ## ##
########
 #    # 
Druhý typ vetřelce se liší siluetou, ale má stejné rozměry a stejnou kolizní oblast.</comment><value name="px"><block type="variables_get" id="b0394"><field name="VAR" id="v_invader_x">invader_x</field></block></value><value name="py"><block type="variables_get" id="b0395"><field name="VAR" id="v_invader_y">invader_y</field></block></value><value name="data"><shadow type="text" id="t0396"><field name="TEXT">bytearray(b'\x18\x3c\x15\x1e\x1e\x15\x3c\x18'), 8, 8</field></shadow></value></block></statement><next><block type="controls_if" id="b0406"><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Výběr grafiky pro spodní řádek.</comment><value name="IF0"><block type="logic_compare" id="b0401"><field name="OP">EQ</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Spodní řádek používá sprite typu C.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0399"><field name="VAR" id="v_row">row</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0400"><field name="NUM">2</field></shadow></value></block></value><statement name="DO0"><block type="fb_draw_pic" id="b0405"><field name="name">Invader_C_8x6</field><field name="alpha">-1</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Sprite C, 8×6 px:
   ##   
  ####  
 ###### 
## ## ##
########
  #  #  
Grafika je záměrně jednoduchá, aby ji žáci mohli snadno překreslit nebo modifikovat.</comment><value name="px"><block type="variables_get" id="b0402"><field name="VAR" id="v_invader_x">invader_x</field></block></value><value name="py"><block type="variables_get" id="b0403"><field name="VAR" id="v_invader_y">invader_y</field></block></value><value name="data"><shadow type="text" id="t0404"><field name="TEXT">bytearray(b'\x18\x1c\x36\x1f\x1f\x36\x1c\x18'), 8, 8</field></shadow></value></block></statement></block></next></block></next></block></statement></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></statement></block></statement><next><block type="controls_if" id="b0425"><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Vykreslení hráčovy střely.</comment><value name="IF0"><block type="logic_compare" id="b0418"><field name="OP">EQ</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Hráčovu střelu kreslíme pouze, když je aktivní.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0416"><field name="VAR" id="v_bullet_active">bullet_active</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0417"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value></block></value><statement name="DO0"><block type="fb_rect_fill" id="b0424"><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Hráčova střela je jednoduchý 1×3px obdélník. Na tak malém displeji je dobře čitelný a levný na vykreslení.</comment><value name="px"><block type="variables_get" id="b0419"><field name="VAR" id="v_bullet_x">bullet_x</field></block></value><value name="py"><block type="variables_get" id="b0420"><field name="VAR" id="v_bullet_y">bullet_y</field></block></value><value name="sirka"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0421"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value><value name="vyska"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0422"><field name="NUM">3</field></shadow></value><value name="col"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0423"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value></block></statement><next><block type="controls_if" id="b0435"><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Vykreslení nepřátelské střely.</comment><value name="IF0"><block type="logic_compare" id="b0428"><field name="OP">EQ</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Stejně podmíněně kreslíme nepřátelskou střelu.</comment><value name="A"><block type="variables_get" id="b0426"><field name="VAR" id="v_enemy_bullet_active">enemy_bullet_active</field></block></value><value name="B"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0427"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value></block></value><statement name="DO0"><block type="fb_rect_fill" id="b0434"><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Nepřátelská střela používá stejný jednoduchý tvar. Směr pohybu odliší její chování.</comment><value name="px"><block type="variables_get" id="b0429"><field name="VAR" id="v_enemy_bullet_x">enemy_bullet_x</field></block></value><value name="py"><block type="variables_get" id="b0430"><field name="VAR" id="v_enemy_bullet_y">enemy_bullet_y</field></block></value><value name="sirka"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0431"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value><value name="vyska"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0432"><field name="NUM">3</field></shadow></value><value name="col"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0433"><field name="NUM">1</field></shadow></value></block></statement><next><block type="fb_draw_pic" id="inv_player_ship"><field name="name">Player_ship_11x6</field><field name="alpha">-1</field><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Hráčova loď, 11×6 px:
     #     
    ###    
   #####   
  #######  
 ######### 
###########
Loď kreslíme až téměř nakonec, takže její neprůhledná bitmapa zůstane vizuálně navrchu.</comment><value name="px"><block type="variables_get" id="b0436"><field name="VAR" id="v_player_x">player_x</field></block></value><value name="py"><shadow type="math_number" id="n0437"><field name="NUM">57</field></shadow></value><value name="data"><shadow type="text" id="t0438"><field name="TEXT">bytearray(b'\x20\x30\x38\x3c\x3e\x3f\x3e\x3c\x38\x30\x20'), 11, 8</field></shadow></value><next><block type="oded_refresh" id="inv_refresh"><comment pinned="false" h="110" w="520">Hotový framebuffer odešleme na OLED. Tím končí jeden herní snímek a program okamžitě pokračuje dalším průchodem PROGRAM LOOP.</comment></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></next></block></statement></block>
